000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TLODCSAS.
000400 AUTHOR.               K MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         JAN. 7, 1988.
000600 INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000800*REMARKS.
001000**************************************************************
001100*                                                            *
001200*   T L O D C S A S   THIS IS AN INITIAL LOAD PROGRAM        *
001300*    FOR CORPORATE STORES ACCOUNTING.  THIS PROGRAM LOADS    *
001400*    THE CODE INFORMATION USING THE 'STORES' DATA BASE IN    *
001500*    CSIS.  THE ONHAND LESS ANY OPEN RECEIVABLES WILL BE     *
001600*    THE BEGINNING BALANCE UNITS. THE DOLLARS ARE CALCULATED *
001700*    USING AVERAGE COST AND BEGINNING UNITS.  THIS PROGRAM   *
001800*    CAN BE EXECUTED IN REPORT MODE OR UPDATE MODE.          *
001900*    THIS PROGRAM CAN BE USED BY A PLANT ALREADY LIVE ON     *
002000*    CSAS IN WHICH CASE IT WILL ONLY LOAD CODES NOT ALREADY  *
002100*    IN THE CSAS DATA BASE.  SINCE THE PLANT IS ALREADY LIVE *
002200*    THE UNITS AND VALUE ARE PLACED IN ACCOUNTING ADJUSTMENT *
002300*    UNITS AND DOLLARS INSTEAD OF BEGINNING UNITS AND DOLLARS*
002400*                                                            *
002500**************************************************************
002600*    17NOV89 DAP - ADDED LOGIC TO USE MARKET COST INSTEAD OF *
002700*                  AVERAGE COST IF AVERAGE COST IS EQUAL TO  *
002800*                  ZERO.                                     *
002900**************************************************************
003000*C  09/16/1992     DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6256
003100*C  CHANGED ALL REFERENCES TO DATASET MCLASS FROM THE CSACCT
003200*C  DB TO THE STORES DB.
003300*C************************************************************
003400*C  09/29/1992     DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6269
003500*C  ADDED SORTSPACE=5000 TO THE $CONTROL STATEMENT.  ALSO ADDED
003600*C  A SPECIFIED NUMBER OF RECORDS TO THE SORT-FILE SELECT STMT.
003700*C************************************************************
003800*C  05OCT1994      DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6533
003900*C  RECOMPILED TO PICK UP A NEW FIELD IN MCLASS.
004000*C************************************************************
      *C  09MAY1995      CATHY ZUBEK
      *C    MODIFIED HP VERSION FOR AS/400 FOR CARTERSVILLE.
      *C************************************************************
      *C  16SEP1996      DAVE PLUM
      *C    REVISED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C************************************************************
004100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
